nd-what-becomes-locked-in-on-a-time-horizon-of-years-to-a-decade-or-more-in-ways-that-can-contradict-the-efficiency-only-framing-of-c1c4)523 0 R(dead-end-an-exergy-ceiling-that-bakes-in-current-hx-approach-temperature-gaps-and-steam-metallurgy-limits)527 0 R(dead-end-curzon-ahlborn-as-the-more-realistic-law-permitted-ceiling)526 0 R(dead-end-reporting-the-naive-single-reservoir-carnot-gap-19-points-as-the-headline-figure)528 0 R(dead-end-resolving-crescent-dunes-and-gemasolars-exact-cycle-parameters-from-secondary-sources)529 0 R(dead-end-the-290-c-cold-salt-tank-as-the-cold-reservoir)525 0 R(executive-summary)514 0 R(thermal-to-electric-ceiling-for-a-565c-molten-salt-csp-tower)513 0 R]>>>>>>
